  "findings": [
    "All 107 masters inspected in nine labelled Game.portrait loader galleries at 150x225 and 86x129. Full heads, complete visible hands, connected thighs, distinct ages/builds and role gear remain readable; no alpha rectangles.",
    "Ten normal/compact selection and dossier captures preserve readable faces, clothing and labels, including Neo scene routing and current Emily refinement.",
    "Solo and four-person cafe scenes keep complete silhouettes, speech controls and in-person routing. Preview-only 2:3 fitting improves Garrett/Rei relative stature; legacy captures retained for comparison.",
    "Arthur Finch, Keiko Tan and Jonah Price render in actual local conversation views at their routines.",
    "Spades, Team 9 and Yokai render in normal/compact in-person combat; masks stay opaque, local effects do not dominate body fitting, action controls remain visible.",
    "Wardrobe baseline discards alpha. A preview-only RGBA change displays the complete Ivan cutout on the existing dark slate surface; both captures inspected.",
    "Headroom varies: every silhouette clears top/sides at alpha>=16, although many margins are tighter than preferred 3-5%. Bottom cutoff may coincide with image edge. No knees, clipped crowns, elbows or fingers accepted."
  ],
